      "message": "Actually, the static method cannot be mocked until dexmaker 2.16.1 with explicit code change.\nhttps://moltmann.github.io/dexmaker/com/android/dx/mockito/inline/extended/ExtendedMockito.html\nThat implies, after we make NetworkPolicyManagerInternal.isUidNetworkingBlocked static, CS will apply its logic automatically regardless of the mocked NPMS instance, so we could remove these mock code.\nIs that ok?",
